{"ticker":"AIZ","updated":"2026-10-30T22:33:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Assurant, Inc.","shortName":"Assurant, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.assurant.com","fullTimeEmployees":14800,"marketCap":14441998336,"trailingPE":14.016275,"forwardPE":12.48506,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0732598,"pegRatio":2.16,"targetMeanPrice":326.66666,"targetHighPrice":355.0,"targetLowPrice":300.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":6,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":0.094,"earningsGrowth":0.305,"grossMargins":0.13272999,"operatingMargins":0.11734,"profitMargins":0.07903,"totalRevenue":13456199680,"beta":0.525,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":303.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":207.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.2},"summary":"Assurant, Inc. provides protection services to connected devices, homes, and automobiles in North America, Latin America, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through Global Lifestyle and Global Housing segments. The Global Lifestyle segment offers mobile device solutions, and extended service contracts and related services for consumer electronics and appliances, and credit and other insurance products; and vehicle protection, commercial equipment protection, and other related services. The Global Housing segment provides lender-placed homeowners, manufactured housing, and flood insurance; renters insurance and other products; and voluntary manufactured housing, and condominium and homeowners insurance products. The company was formerly known as Fortis, Inc. and changed its name to Assurant, Inc. in February 2004. Assurant, Inc. was founded in 1892 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"Assurant, Inc. 為北美、拉丁美洲、歐洲和亞太地區的連網設備、家庭和汽車提供保護服務。它透過全球生活方式和全球住房部門運作。全球生活風格部門提供行動裝置解決方案、消費性電子產品和電器、信貸和其他保險產品的擴展服務合約和相關服務；以及車輛保護、商業設備保護等相關服務。全球住房部門提供貸方安置的房主、預製住房和洪水保險；房客保險和其他產品；以及自願製造的住房、公寓和房屋保險產品。該公司前身為 Fortis, Inc.，並於 2004 年 2 月更名為 Assurant, Inc.。 Assurant, Inc. 成立於 1892 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":214.11,"h":214.93,"l":212.59,"c":214.57,"v":508700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":212.33,"h":215.26,"l":212.33,"c":214.89,"v":358400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":216.58,"h":217.35,"l":215.34,"c":216.51,"v":351700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":216.37,"h":217.51,"l":210.63,"c":211.17,"v":417200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":210.77,"h":212.32,"l":207.54,"c":211.75,"v":370400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":211.54,"h":212.35,"l":210.9,"c":211.1,"v":269600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":209.92,"h":211.27,"l":208.53,"c":209.4,"v":205100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":210.01,"h":213.47,"l":209.18,"c":213.31,"v":256200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":212.11,"h":213.97,"l":212.11,"c":213.01,"v":246500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":213.74,"h":214.2,"l":208.22,"c":208.49,"v":273700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":208.61,"h":208.62,"l":205.01,"c":205.44,"v":331700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":205.56,"h":211.35,"l":205.29,"c":209.5,"v":439500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":208.25,"h":211.12,"l":208.07,"c":209.07,"v":352000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":209.08,"h":210.23,"l":207.82,"c":209.6,"v":561700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":209.25,"h":211.74,"l":207.61,"c":211.19,"v":382800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":210.8,"h":213.62,"l":210.51,"c":212.5,"v":371500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":212.0,"h":215.26,"l":212.0,"c":215.19,"v":441300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":215.39,"h":216.57,"l":212.1,"c":216.0,"v":480400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":217.51,"h":218.7,"l":215.27,"c":215.62,"v":362800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":215.67,"h":215.85,"l":213.21,"c":214.45,"v":224000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":214.19,"h":217.02,"l":214.19,"c":216.6,"v":254700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":215.14,"h":219.02,"l":215.14,"c":217.48,"v":360700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":216.34,"h":219.42,"l":215.77,"c":218.36,"v":244800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":218.0,"h":221.78,"l":217.53,"c":220.0,"v":260800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":220.61,"h":221.95,"l":219.63,"c":221.69,"v":261300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":221.7,"h":223.65,"l":216.17,"c":216.